WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.466
机器人能学会从自己的失误中恢复吗？
Can a robot learn to recover from its own mistakes?

00:00:03.726 --> 00:00:07.605
FailPoint-X 研究如何利用人类接管数据，对机器人策略进行离线后训练。
FailPoint-X studies offline post-training from human takeovers.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:13.208
黑色的书本该放进收纳架的前格，机器人却放偏了。
The black book belongs in the front compartment of the caddy. The robot has already missed.

00:00:13.468 --> 00:00:16.466
看这两种策略从同一个失败状态重新开始。
Watch two policies restart from exactly that moment.

00:00:16.726 --> 00:00:23.061
这次回放中，基础策略最终超时。用人类纠正轨迹训练过的策略把书放回了前格。
In this replay, the base policy times out. The policy trained on human recoveries puts the book away.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:29.026
只看总体成功率，很难分清机器人是避开了错误，还是出错后又完成了任务。
An overall success rate hides whether the robot avoided a mistake or recovered after making it.

00:00:29.286 --> 00:00:33.984
多训练一段时间也可能带来提升。人类纠正本身贡献了多少？
And extra training alone might help. How much do the human corrections contribute?

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.431
我们记录同一个策略检查点产生的失败轨迹，由标注者圈出每次失败开始的时间区间。
We record failures from one checkpoint. An annotator marks the interval where each failure begins.

00:00:40.691 --> 00:00:45.715
训练时，我们从这些区间内抽取状态，让操作者接管机器人，完成原任务。
A human takes over from sampled states in training intervals and finishes the original task.

00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:50.505
各方法采用相同的训练预算，评测时都从同一组留出失败区间的中点重新开始。
We match the training budget, then restart every method at the same held-out midpoints.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:57.405
数据覆盖 10 个任务族、5 个难度等级，共收录 2,400 条通过验收的人类恢复轨迹。
Across ten task families and five levels, we collect 2,400 accepted human recoveries.

00:00:57.665 --> 00:01:03.663
其中 80 条留作开发。9 种方法在相同的 384 个留出失败状态上接受评测。
Eighty are reserved for development. Nine methods face the same 384 held-out failure states.

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:11.597
在恢复评测中，Demo-continue 的成功率为 22.5%，Takeover-BC 为 51.9%。
Demo-continue recovers in 22.5 percent of trials. Takeover-BC recovers in 51.9 percent.

00:01:11.857 --> 00:01:17.231
两者训练预算相同，在 L1–L3 的恢复成功率相差 29.4 个百分点。
At equal training budgets, that is a 29.4 percentage point gain on levels one through three.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:24.934
从常规起点出发，Base-restart 的成功率为 43.9%。
From ordinary starts, Base-restart succeeds in 43.9 percent of trials.

00:01:25.194 --> 00:01:31.576
Takeover-BC 的常规起点成功率为 14%。恢复能力提高了，常规任务表现却下降了。
Takeover-BC succeeds in 14 percent of trials. Recovery and retention tell different stories.
